Z||000000||kempo||09-03-2001||12:54 AM||||Coming back from Harrisburg, on 81S, there was the semitruck who was driving very erratically.  Two lane highway.  First, I gave him some room, then waited for a clean shot to pass.  I finally get one, and passed the guy, doing about 10 over (speed limit of 65).  Then he pulled into my lane right behind me, sped up, and was literally right on my bumper.  I pull in the other lane, and he pulls right behind me, and there is no other cars anywhere on the road.  Pulled into the other lane, and again, he pulls behind me.  I was really starting to get po'ed and sped way the hell up and pulled far far away from him.  After I bit of driving real fast, I relax a bit and do the limit.  About 7-8 minutes later, he's back, only I swear he was trying to kill me.  I was in the right lane, and he was coming up on the left.  Right when he was about half way past me, cuts into my lane, and I jam the brakes hard and pulled off to the side of the road.  I then called the police and reported the guy, and waited about 5 minutes.  After about 20 miles up the road, I see the same truck pulled over with 2 police officers.  <P>I hope the rest of you guys have a safe holiday weekend and better luck on the road than I did.<BR>...&lt;grin&gt;...<P>-Kemp||||reg||1
